{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026cX0WJsQpWJ1795618904.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>再有五間中學獲教育局批准於下學年中一擴班，由四班增至五班，包括東區港島民生書院、聖馬可中學、北區香港道教聯合會鄧顯紀念中學、粉嶺禮賢會中學，以及田家炳中學。</p><p></p><p>教育局指，本學年共接獲15間學校申請，希望由四班增至五班，參加來年中一派位，經詳細審視學校配套、辦學往績，以及香港學額供求情況等因素後，批准五間學校在來年中一擴班。</p><p></p><p>局方是在去年推出先導計劃，在2025/26至2028/29學年，每年容許五間符合特定條件的學校擴班。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T15:23:58.319184+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T08:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T17:17:34.763672+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T15:17:19.997921+00:00","content_hash":"a531cc260624f0f8a51c65e16f969712ada80233b755d5148209e8f678c34c5c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T15:23:58.319184+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}